        <briefdescription>
<para>Computes the sum of two metric attributes. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The sum is the simple sum, value(a) + value(b), if and only if name(a) equals name(b), or one or both of name(a), name(b) is the empty string. Otherwise, the returned metric has an empty name and a value of 0.</para><para><simplesect kind="note"><para>By the condition above, the sum of many attributes with differing names is not well-defined. </para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
