    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This submodule defines the metric attribute, <ref refid="classRoseHPCT_1_1MetricAttr" kindref="compound">RoseHPCT::MetricAttr</ref>, which is interpreted from the profile IR (<ref refid="group__ROSEHPCT__PROFIR" kindref="compound">ROSE-HPCT Profile IR</ref>) and is derived from <ref refid="classAstAttribute" kindref="compound">AstAttribute</ref> so that it can be attached to Sage nodes.</para><para>In addition, this submodule provides a variety of support routines for traversing the Sage III IR and propagating metrics from low-level scopes to higher-level scopes (e.g., from statements to their surrounding loop and function scopes).</para><para><simplesect kind="rcs"><title>Id</title><para><ref refid="sage_8hh" kindref="compound">sage.hh</ref>,v 1.1 2008/01/08 02:56:43 dquinlan Exp </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
  </compounddef>
